-5/8\"","hole_size_in":"12-1/4\"","shoe_depth_m":3142.9,"cement_top_m":2382.8,"cementing_notes":"Cemented with spacer and low-density lead; bond acceptable on CBL.","order_index":2},{"id":52,"well_id":"NHK-02","string_type":"Production","size_in":"7\"","hole_size_in":"8-1/2\"","shoe_depth_m":4446.6,"cement_top_m":3914.1,"cementing_notes":"Cemented with 15.8 ppg tail slurry; CBL good bond across pay zone. Cementing issue recorded at 4,426 m (Low); see events.","order_index":3}],"events":[{"id":71,"well_id":"NHK-02","depth_m":842.0,"formation":"Dhekiajuli","event_type":"Tight Hole","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":10.7,"mud_weight_ppg":9.1,"description":"Restricted movement after connection at 842 m MD (Dhekiajuli); reamed stand three times.","mitigation":"Back-reamed interval, pumped hi-vis sweeps and raised mud inhibition (KCl) to reduce clay swelling.","lesson_learned":"Hole cleaning limits ROP in Dhekiajuli; drill at a controlled rate.","source_doc":"DDR NHK-02 · 2004-02-21","event_date":"2004-02-21","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"NHK-02 · 842 m"},{"id":72,"well_id":"NHK-02","depth_m":1921.0,"formation":"Girujan","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":28.3,"mud_weight_ppg":9.7,"description":"Torque spike to 12.8 kft-lb at 1,921 m MD (Girujan); string stalled twice before parameters were reduced.","mitigation":"Lowered RPM, added lubricant to mud system and reamed the interval before drilling ahead.","lesson_learned":"Expect torque increase in Girujan coal seams; pre-empt with lubricant and a stabilised BHA.","source_doc":"DDR NHK-02 · 2004-04-10","event_date":"2004-04-10","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"NHK-02 · 1,921 m"},{"id":73,"well_id":"NHK-02","depth_m":2531.0,"formation":"Tipam","event_type":"Mud Loss","severity":"Low","severity_rank":0,"npt_hours":3.2,"mud_weight_ppg":9.8,"description":"Sudden loss of returns at 2,531 m MD in Tipam; loss rate 4 bbl/hr. Standpipe pressure d